  "id": "cognitive-task-analysis",
  "term": "cognitive task analysis",
  "definition": "Cognitive task analysis is an approach used to study how people think and use knowledge while carrying out complex real-world work. In this packet, it is described as using knowledge-elicitation methods such as semi-structured interviews to uncover the cognitive challenges, adaptive skills, and flexible decision making involved in practice.",
